### **Intuition**

The problem asks us to divide an array into two subsets such that the absolute difference between their sums is minimized.

Instead of trying to track two separate sums, we can simplify the problem by focusing on just **one** subset. If we calculate the sum of one subset, the second subset is simply whatever is left over.

We use **Recursion with Memoization (Top-Down DP)** to explore all possible sums we can generate.

